Task 2 ReadMe (MTR Route Finder)

Project Description:
This project is about MTR Route Finder than can find the shortest route base on starting point and destination using Breadth‑First Search. In addition, total travelling time calculator function also provided. Since user can take multiple MTR line and use different interchange station but still can arrive at user’s destination. This application can make sure user take the most direct way toward their destination and save the travel time.

Features:
	Use Graphs to store MTR stations and corresponding train line
	Find shortest path using Breadth‑First Search (BFS)
	Calculate total travel time
	Provide a GUI

Install Required Libraries:
	json
	tkinter
	collections

Download the Project Files:
The "Task 2" file include “main.py”, “UI.py” ,"README.me" and “mtr.json”.

Run the Program:
Open “Task 2” file in code editor, then select “UI.py” and run it. A window will pop up.

Troubleshooting:
Tkinter window does not pop up. 
Make sure tkinder is installed properly.

JSON file not found.
Make sure JSON file is in same folder as “UI.py” and “main.py”.
